WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:01.759
An individual must be respected,

00:00:01.759 --> 00:00:05.280
regardless of their religion, colour, gender

00:00:05.280 --> 00:00:07.119
or where they are from.

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:13.479
By taking us captive,

00:00:13.479 --> 00:00:16.280
Islamic State wanted to strip us of our honour.

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:19.839
ISIS wanted to break our will to live.

00:00:19.839 --> 00:00:22.159
They took my mother,

00:00:22.159 --> 00:00:25.360
who believed in the core values of humanity,

00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:28.800
captive along with 86 Yazidi women in Soulagh.

00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:35.039
ISIS killed them all because they did not want to be sex slaves.

00:00:35.039 --> 00:00:38.959
Today, my community is falling apart because of brutal genocide.

00:00:38.959 --> 00:00:42.519
Half a million people are uncertain about their future: Where can they go?

00:00:43.439 --> 00:00:46.920
We must fight terrorism and we must cut it off at the source.

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:48.839
We must also fight extremism and racism,

00:00:48.839 --> 00:00:50.879
which have become such dangers today.

00:00:50.879 --> 00:00:53.280
An international accountability system

00:00:53.280 --> 00:00:55.000
and a local counterpart must be set up to bring justice.

00:00:55.959 --> 00:00:59.200
You decided to stand by Yazidi women

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.400
and the Yazidi community against genocide.

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.879
We look up to Europe as a symbol of humanity.

00:01:04.879 --> 00:01:07.759
Europe should remain a model for the entire world

00:01:07.759 --> 00:01:13.479
and a model for the coexistence of peoples and their cultures.

00:01:13.479 --> 00:01:18.479
I say to ISIS, and all terrorists in the world,

00:01:18.479 --> 00:01:22.200
if you have chosen the path of no dignity,

00:01:22.200 --> 00:01:26.720
Europe has chosen for itself the path of humanity and honour.

00:01:26.720 --> 00:01:28.560
Thank you.

